# Vestie — project context (always in scope)

> New chats have **no memory** of prior conversations. This file + linked docs are the source of truth.

## What Vestie is

**Collaborative group savings** Flutter app (Android & iOS). Users create/join **projects** (vacation, emergency, investment), contribute from a **wallet**, borrow from group pots (vacation/emergency), pay via **Stripe**, connect via **VFF**, and complete **KYC** for withdraw.

Vestie is **not a bank** — risk disclaimers required; leaders set repayment terms.

## Roles & code folders

| Role | API `viewerRole` | Code |
|------|------------------|------|
| Group Leader | `GroupLeader` | `lib/leader/features/` |
| Co-Leader | `CoLeader` | vacation/emergency only |
| Member | `Member` | `lib/user/features/` |
| Shared | all | `lib/features/`, `lib/core/`, `lib/app/` |

## Project categories

| Category | Borrow | Co-leader | Detail route |
|----------|--------|-----------|--------------|
| Vacation | Yes | Yes | `/project/detail` |
| Emergency | Yes | Yes | `/project/detail` |
| Investment | No | No | `/project/investment-detail` |

Public join → instant active membership. Private → pending until leader approves.

## Must-not-break flows (unless task explicitly changes them)

- Auth → agreement → dashboard (`/dashboard` tabs: Home, Discover, +, Wallet, Profile)
- Wallet: deposit, withdraw, Stripe PaymentSheet, SignalR `/hubs/wallet`
- Contribute, borrow (vacation/emergency), KYC, bank link (`vestie://kyc/*`, `vestie://bank/*`)
- Invite deep links `/join/:inviteCode`
- Project detail, leader moderation, investment distribution
- VFF hub `/user/vff`
- Routes: **`AppRoutes` only** — typed `GoRouter` extras

